$ fm-pr-lint.py --pr-url https://github.com/SpeakableAuto/firstmate/pull/41
refuse: goal; fix: put Goal: followed by a concrete outcome on the first substantive line
refuse: carve-outs; fix: declare exactly one Carve-outs: line listing payments, logins-keys-secrets, shared-database-schema, or none
